摘要中的主要功能必须被所选片段支持。优先把改变用途含义的条件写进摘要，不能只藏在limitations。遇到“阶段1骨架”“cloud provider待实现”“匿名thread后续实现”等，摘要明确当前仅本地草稿/审批落盘，不说已实现匿名网络或云端发布。Codex/模型登录适配归coding-development；Oopz等语音房的对话连接归communication-integrations。自述兼容或性能用“作者称/README注明”，不冒充本次验证。
格式示例（仅结构，不是来源事实）：evidence:[{"paragraph_id":"p3s1","fact":"该片段支持的中文转述"}]。请从本次真实输入挑选编号。","role":"system"},{"content":"{"metadata":{"description":"Drive the open-source ArtCraft studio apps — PhotoCraft, FilmCraft, EffectCraft... — from DeepSeek Harness, in chat or from your own UI.","id":"gh:1412884671","install_available":true,"language":"JavaScript","name":"dsh-artcraft","slug":"NINKCH/dsh-artcraft","topics":["artcraft","deepseek-harness-plugin","dsh-plugin"]},"paragraphs":[{"id":"p1s1","text":"Drive the open-source ArtCraft studio apps — PhotoCraft, FilmCraft, EffectCraft... — from DeepSeek H"},{"id":"p1s2","text":"arness, in chat or from your own UI."},{"id":"p2s1","text":"# ArtCraft Bridge"},{"id":"p3s1","text":"**Drive the open-source ArtCraft studio apps — PhotoCraft, FilmCraft, EffectCraft — from DeepSeek Ha"},{"id":"p3s2","text":"rness, in chat or from your own UI.**"},{"id":"p4s1","text":"English | 简体中文"},{"id":"p5s1","text":"`@ninkch/dsh-artcraft` · a DeepSeek Harness plugin · Apache-2.0"},{"id":"p6s1","text":"## Why this exists"},{"id":"p7s1","text":"ArtCraft is a family of **fourteen** free, fair-source reinventions\nof Adobe's studio tools, written"},{"id":"p7s2","text":" from scratch in pure Rust: **PhotoCraft** (Photoshop),\n**VectorCraft** (Illustrator), **FilmCraft**"},{"id":"p7s3","text":" (Premiere Pro), **LightCraft** (Lightroom),\n**PdfCraft** (Acrobat), **EffectCraft** (After Effects)"},{"id":"p7s4","text":", **DesignCraft** (InDesign),\n**WordCraft** (Word), **DeckCraft** (PowerPoint), **GridCraft** (Excel"},{"id":"p7s5","text":"), **CADCraft** (AutoCAD),\n**SoundCraft** (Pro Tools), **FigCraft** (Figma) and **SolidCraft** (3D p"},{"id":"p7s6","text":"arametric CAD).\nThey share one superpower that most desktop\napps don't have: **every menu item, slid"},{"id":"p7s7","text":"er and dialog is a command**, and the exact same commands\ncan be driven from a headless CLI, a JSON "},{"id":"p7s8","text":"control channel, or an MCP server. The apps were built\nfor agents from day one."},{"id":"p8s1","text":"This plugin brings that surface into DeepSeek Harness, so an AI agent can *operate* the apps —\nnot j"},{"id":"p8s2","text":"ust talk about them:"},{"id":"p9s1","text":"- **In chat** — ten agent tools let any Harness session check the toolchain, run CLI commands,\nsend "},{"id":"p9s2","text":"control-channel commands to a running app, do bridged file operations, run delivery QC,\nand consult "},{"id":"p9s3","text":"a per-app capability catalog.\n- **A bundled craft skill pack** — eleven skills (`artcraft-ops`, `art"},{"id":"p9s4","text":"craft-shot-language`,\n`artcraft-edit-rhythm`, `artcraft-color-light`, `artcraft-sound-design`, `artc"},{"id":"p9s5","text":"raft-motion-vfx`,\n`artcraft-delivery-qc`, `artcraft-style-bible`, `artcraft-film-study`, `artcraft-b"},{"id":"p9s6","text":"atch-pipeline`,\n`artcraft-multicam`) teach the agent *how* to drive the suite fluently, which effect"},{"id":"p9s7","text":" to reach for,\nhow to design shot language, pacing, grade and sound, how to lock a consistent look a"},{"id":"p9s8","text":"cross\nepisodes, how to break a film down into evidence, how to run batches, and how to cut multicam."},{"id":"p9s9","text":"\nThey ship inside the plugin and load on demand (English index: `skills/README.md`).\n- **In the brow"},{"id":"p9s10","text":"ser** — a same-origin HTTP API (`/artcraft/api/*`) that any Harness web UI can call,\nno CORS, no key"},{"id":"p9s11","text":"s. It was built for 无限画布 / infinite-canvas,\na node-based AI short-drama storyboard canvas, but any f"},{"id":"p9s12","text":"ront end can use it.\n- **Paths belong to the caller** — this plugin is a bridge and owns no data dir"},{"id":"p9s13","text":"ectory. Files read\n[该节后续省略]"},{"id":"p10s1","text":"## How it fits together"},{"id":"p11s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p12s1","text":"Everything runs locally. No cloud round-trips, no accounts, no telemetry."},{"id":"p13s1","text":"## Requirements"},{"id":"p14s1","text":"- **DeepSeek Harness** (desktop), any platform the Harness supports.\n- **ArtCraft apps** — grab what"},{"id":"p14s2","text":" you need from getartcraft.com\nor the storytold GitHub releases. The portable/installer builds\nship "},{"id":"p14s3","text":"the CLI binaries on Windows and Linux (`photocraft-cli.exe` …); macOS ships them as a\nseparate notar"},{"id":"p14s4","text":"ized zip. Versions tested: PhotoCraft 0.9, FilmCraft 0.8, EffectCraft (early).\n- Nothing else. No Py"},{"id":"p14s5","text":"thon, no FFmpeg — the ArtCraft apps bring their own codecs."},{"id":"p15s1","text":"## Setup"},{"id":"p16s1","text":"**1. Get the plugin onto disk** (this repository). Any folder works; keeping it inside the Harness\nw"},{"id":"p16s2","text":"orkspace next to your other local plugins is the convention."},{"id":"p17s1","text":"**2. Register it with your Harness profile.** A Harness profile is a pnpm package at\n`C:\\Users\\<you>"},{"id":"p17s2","text":"\\.dsh\\profiles\\<profile>\\` (desktop profile by default). Two edits:"},{"id":"p18s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p19s1","text":"Then link and restart the Harness once (Host-side code loads at startup):"},{"id":"p20s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p21s1","text":"> If your Harness build ships a plugin manager UI that installs from a folder, that works too —\n> it"},{"id":"p21s2","text":" ends up writing exactly the two lines above."},{"id":"p22s1","text":"**3. Configure** `artcraft.config.json` (copy from\n`artcraft.config.json.example`). Recommended loca"},{"id":"p22s2","text":"tion: `C:\\Users\\<you>\\.dsh\\artcraft.config.json`\n(persists across plugin updates); placing it next t"},{"id":"p22s3","text":"o `index.js` also works (legacy). The file is\nre-read on every request — no restart needed for path "},{"id":"p22s4","text":".js` also works (legacy). The file is\nre-read on every request — no restart needed for path changes:"},{"id":"p23s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p24s1","text":"**4. Verify.** In any Harness chat, ask your agent to run `artcraft_status`. Green lights across\n`bi"},{"id":"p24s2","text":"ns.*.found` and you're done."},{"id":"p25s1","text":"## Driving it from chat"},{"id":"p26s1","text":"The plugin registers ten tools. The agent composes them, so plain language works:"},{"id":"p27s1","text":"> *\"Color-grade every PNG in `demo/media` with a soft S-curve and smart sharpening at 80, put the\n> "},{"id":"p27s2","text":"results in `demo/out/graded`.\"*"},{"id":"p28s1","text":"Behind that sentence the agent will typically do:"},{"id":"p29s1","text":"[代码示例省略，未执行]"},{"id":"p30s1","text":"| Tool | What it does |"},{"id":"p31s1","text":"| `artcraft_status` | Toolchain health check: which of the 14 CLIs resolved, config location, contro"},{"id":"p31s2","text":"l ports, running jobs |\n| `artcraft_cli` | Run any CLI subcommand synchronously (`photocraft-cli run"},{"id":"p31s3","text":"/batch`, `wordcraft-cli convert`, …) |\n| `artcraft_control` | One command over the JSON control chan"},{"id":"p31s4","text":"nel of a *running* app (filmcraft 9876 / effectcraft 9877 / vectorcraft 7979 / lightcraft 7980, or p"},{"id":"p31s5","text":"ass `port`) |\n| `artcraft_fs` | Bridged file ops — list / stat / read / write / mkdir at caller-deci"},{"id":"p31s6","text":"ded absolute paths |\n| `artcraft_discover` | Family install auto-discovery: fills missing paths, aut"},{"id":"p31s7","text":"o-corrects stale ones |\n| `artcraft_apps` | Capability catalog for all 14 apps: CLI subcommands, con"},{"id":"p31s8","text":"trol ports, MCP, repo/docs links, plus measured command-family stats |\n| `artcraft_qc` | Delivery QC"},{"id":"p31s9","text":": family probe + platform-spec checks returning ok/warn/fail/manual with fix commands (video/audio/i"},{"id":"p31s10","text":"mage/pdf/doc/sheet/deck/fig/cad) |\n| `artcraft_live` | Control-channel liveness: which apps are runn"},{"id":"p31s11","text":"ing right now (ready for live tuning) |\n[该节后续省略]"},{"id":"p32s1","text":"## Driving it from the browser"},{"id":"p33s1","text":"Same-origin HTTP, JSON in and out. The workhorse pattern is the **job lifecycle** — start, poll,\nfet"},{"id":"p33s2","text":"ch — which keeps long renders off the request cycle:"},{"id":"p34s1","text":"[该节后续省略]"},{"id":"p35s1","text":"## Security & trust model"},{"id":"p36s1","text":"The HTTP surface has **no authentication** and rides on the Harness web server, which listens on\nloo"},{"id":"p36s2","text":"pback only — treat the port as trusted-local and don't expose it to a network; put a reverse\nproxy w"},{"id":"p36s3","text":"ith auth in front if you must. Child processes are locked to the thirteen allow-listed\nfamily CLIs; "},{"id":"p36s4","text":"the control channel only ever dials `127.0.0.1`."}],"truncated":true}","role":"user"}],"model":"MiniMax-M3.1-Flash","reasoning_effort":"low","stream":false}
